# CLI development

Run `uv run __COMMAND__ --help`, `uv run __COMMAND__ find greeting`, or
`uv run __COMMAND__ --json greet Ada`. Global options precede the command.

Commands are plain typed functions in `__NAMESPACE__.cli.commands`, registered by
import target in `__NAMESPACE__.cli.registry`. Metadata powers help, search, and docs
without importing leaf modules. Keep business logic in libraries. Delegate async
execution to Cyclopts. Log stable messages with keyword context using Loguru.

Return JSON-native results; the CLI prints results on stdout and logs on stderr.
Validate destructive scopes, provide a side-effect-free dry-run where feasible, and
call `confirm_destructive` before mutation. Unattended execution requires `--yes`.

After registry changes regenerate `docs/cli.md`:

```bash
uv run __COMMAND__ catalog --output docs/cli.md
uv run inv check
uv run inv test.run --project apps/__NAME__-cli
```
